Note functions, helpers and closures over globals end note.
To add numbers with first and second, do
  give back first plus second.
end function.
Set answer to the result of add numbers with 3 and 4.
Say text Three plus four is end text, answer.
Set greeting to text Hello there. end text
To greet with name, do
  Say greeting, name, text Welcome to Plain. end text
end function.
Run greet with text Ada end text.
Set counter to 0.
To bump counter up, do
  Change counter by 1.
end function.
Run bump counter up.
Run bump counter up.
Run bump counter up.
Say text The counter is now end text, counter.
Set price to 19 point 99 rounded.
Say text The price rounds to end text, price.
Set big to the larger of 3 times 4 and 11.
Set small to the smaller of 100 and the square root of 144.
Say text Larger is end text, big, text and smaller is end text, small.
